    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1596">

                <pb facs="1172" n="1056" xml:id="pg1056"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 701.5212/38.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Willard to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-03-13">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 13, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>56. Señor Azcona, Carranza’s diplomatic representative here, has just presented
                    to Minister of State an explanation of Caso incident and I am informed that the
                    Spanish Government has accepted same and, as therein suggested, will send to
                    Mexico confidential agent.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Willard</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
